[assembly: PexAssemblySettings(MaxBranches = 1000)] // we override the default value of maxbranches

namespace MyTests
{
    [PexClass(MaxBranches = 500)] // we override the 1000 value and set maxbranches to 500
    public partial class MyTests
    {
        [PexMethod(MaxBranches = 100)] // we override again, maxbranches = 100
        public void MyTest(...) { ... }
    }
}
```
In this example, the MaxBranches setting is defined at the assembly level with a value of 1000. Then, it's overridden at the fixture level with a value of 500, and then again at the exploration level with a value of 100.
